{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo showcases the core tactical gameplay of <i>Curse of Dominion</i> through two short, standalone battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from two levels via the main menu and engage in grid-based combat inspired by classic tactical RPGs. Your objective in each mission is simple: defeat all enemies. If your lead character, Protag, falls in battle, you will be returned to the main menu to try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Demo Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grid-based tactical combat with position-based decision-making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two distinct levels to preview different enemy formations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn-based gameplay showcasing core mechanics and combat flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick replay loop with no saved progress or persistent data</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please note: This is a very early look at <i>Curse of Dominion</i>. Story content, character systems, and progression are not yet implemented. All content in the demo is subject to change as development continues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I plan to update the demo regularly with new features, improvements, and bug fixes. This prototype is meant to give players and potential supporters a first taste of the battle system in action. Your feedback will help shape the direction of the game moving forward.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3815520?t=1751392741","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3815520?t=1751392741","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815520/3a1a602c07a9ddaa5fe64abee8144e522bdf6985/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751392741","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815520/3a1a602c07a9ddaa5fe64abee8144e522bdf6985/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751392741","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo showcases the core tactical gameplay of <i>Curse of Dominion</i> through two short, standalone battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from two levels via the main menu and engage in grid-based combat inspired by classic tactical RPGs. Your objective in each mission is simple: defeat all enemies. If your lead character, Protag, falls in battle, you will be returned to the main menu to try again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Demo Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grid-based tactical combat with position-based decision-making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two distinct levels to preview different enemy formations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn-based gameplay showcasing core mechanics and combat flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick replay loop with no saved progress or persistent data</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please note: This is a very early look at <i>Curse of Dominion</i>. Story content, character systems, and progression are not yet implemented. All content in the demo is subject to change as development continues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I plan to update the demo regularly with new features, improvements, and bug fixes. This prototype is meant to give players and potential supporters a first taste of the battle system in action. Your feedback will help shape the direction of the game moving forward.</p>","developers":["TAR Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3575920","name":"Curse of Dominion"},"genres":[{"description":